            31→[features]
            32→search = ["mdbook-html/search"]
        README.md
            1→# mdbook-driver
            7→This is the high-level Rust library for running [mdBook](https://rust-lang.github.io/mdBook/). New books can be created using [`BookBuilder`](https://docs.rs/mdbook-driver/latest/mdbook_driver/init/struct.BookBuilder.html). The primary type [`MDBook`](https://docs.rs/mdbook-driver/latest/mdbook_driver/struct.MDBook.html) can be used to manage and render books.
            9→> This crate is maintained by the mdBook team for use by the wider ecosystem. This crate follows [semver compatibility](https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/reference/semver.html) for its APIs.
            11→## License
            13→[Mozilla Public License, version 2.0](https://github.com/rust-lang/mdBook/blob/master/LICENSE)
        src/
