        README.md
            1→# mdbook-markdown
            7→This is the Markdown support library for [mdBook](https://rust-lang.github.io/mdBook/). Rust crates (such as preprocessors) can use this library to process Markdown in the same way as mdBook.
            9→> This crate is maintained by the mdBook team for use by the wider ecosystem. This crate follows [semver compatibility](https://doc.rust-lang.org/cargo/reference/semver.html) for its APIs.
            11→## License
